0..75 Comment "//! `niche-realizability` models a null niche as a realizability predicate."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..159 Comment "//! A realiser is a predicate on a word and heap. `star` splits disjoint heaps."
160..237 Comment "//! `pointsTo` describes a singleton. The normaliser computes assertions. The"
238..274 Comment "//! kernel replays each declaration."
275..278 Comment "//!"
279..358 Comment "//! `Option<&T>` uses one word for null or a reference. Its realisers equal the"
359..434 Comment "//! tagged layout at every heap. Marshallers meet their triples. `deref_or`"
435..499 Comment "//! meets the niche. The pathological source refuses `_Nonnull`."
500..503 Comment "//!"
504..520 Comment "//! - see: #2832"
521..552 Comment "//! - see: #327 — `derefOrWp`"
553..660 Comment "//! - see: `../../pathological/specification/niche-realizability.gandr` — the refused `_Nonnull` neighbor"
661..741 Comment "//! - cites: [Wagner-2024-realistic_realizability_specifying_abis_you_can_count]"
742..933 Comment "//! [Wagner-2024-realistic_realizability_specifying_abis_you_can_count]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3689755 \"Wagner, Eisbach and Ahmed, Realistic Realizability: Specifying ABIs You Can Count On\""
